3. SIDE INCIDENT: CONNECTION REFUSED ON PORT 6443
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Error Encountered on Worker Node:
  The connection to the server 172.31.12.72:6443 was refused - did you specify the right host or port?

Analysis:
  kubectl commands were being executed directly from kubworker-node2, where 
  kubeconfig was pointing to the local worker IP (172.31.12.72) instead of the 
  control plane master IP (172.31.13.232).

Verification Commands:
  On Master:
    sudo crictl ps | grep kube-apiserver
    sudo ss -lntp | grep 6443

  From Worker:
    nc -zv 172.31.13.232 6443


